## CSS Styling

Add this custom CSS in **Customizer > Additional CSS** or your child theme stylesheet:

```
.post-next-nav img {
    margin-left: auto;
}
.post-prev-nav img {
    margin-right: auto;
}
.nav-thumb {
    max-width: 60px;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 4px;
}
```

This will display the post thumbnail alongside the **Next** and **Previous** navigation arrows at the bottom of each single post.

